{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>וישתחו לך</b> defective vav, corresponding to six generations from David until Joram, when Edom enslaved Israel, and from here onward he transgressed against him. And there are in this blessing twenty-six words, to tell you that he blessed him with the honored Name whose value is twenty-six." "<b>הוה</b> — two times in the Masorah: הוה גביר לאחיך / כי לשלג יאמר הוה ארץ. In the merit of Jacob, rain and snow descend."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:13.103315236Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}